    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishiwi lyakwa Yawe lyaishile kuli ine aliti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“We mwana wa muntu, kale kwaliko abanakashi babili abafyelwe inda imo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baikele mu calo ca Egupto, nomba ilyo bali abakashana, balecita ubulalelale baposele ifisungu fyabo, balebapampanta no kubatonya na mabele ku baume yasuka yakopoka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwamukalamba aleitwa Ohola, emukuti e Samaria wine, uwamwaice aleitwa Oliba, emukuti e Yerusalemu wine. Bonse babili nine nabopile, nabo bamfyalila na bana abaume na banakashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nomba Ohola nangu ali mukashi wandi, awe ena akonkanyapofye ukuba cilende, alabilimafye kukutemwisha bacibusa bakwe abaume abena Asiria abali abashilika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abalefwala insalu ishacifufya, bali balashi elyo ne ntungulushi sha fita ishabuteeko. Nabo bonse bali abalumendo abayemba beka abaleendela pali bakabalwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bena Asiria bonse bashimucindikwa, eko Ohola aipeele ukucita nabo ubulalelale, bwasuka ubulalelale bwakwe bwamutwala na kukuikowesha mukulapepa utulubi twa bena Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abikilepofye ukulacita bulalelale ubo atampile mu Egupto, umo aposele icisungu cakwe. Abaume balesendama nankwe balemupampanta balemutonya amabele, no kulacitisha nankwe ifyabupusaushi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi na ine epakumulekamo, pakuti aleyangalila na bacibusa bakwe abena Asiria abo alefwaisha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo basuka bamufuula, bamusha ubwamba, bamupoka bamwane abaume na banakashi, bamwipaya na ku lupanga. Awe na banakashi mpangafye yonse balamulandapo ilyo bamupeseshe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkashi nankwe Oliba nangu amweneko ifyo fyonse, awe wena alicililepo ukuba cimbi cimbifye, no bulalelale bwakwe bwalicilile no bwakwa nkashi nankwe Ohola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oliba alebilimafye kukutemwisha abena Asiria abali abalashi elyo ne ntungulushi sha fita ishabuteeko, na bashilika abalefwala insalu ishisuma, na bamushika abaleendela pali bakabalwe, aba bonse bali abalumendo abayemba beka beka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ine epakumona ukuti awe nao wine ubulalelale bwakwe bwabipisha, balinganafye no wamukalamba ku bubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe bucilende bwakwa Oliba bwalacililakofye asuka alatamba na baume abalengelwe pa cibumba, ifipasho fya bena Kaludea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Abena Kaludea:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mutundu wa bantu abaikele ku calo ca ku kulyo lubali lwa ku musumba wa Babiloni. E mutundu wa balupwa lwakwa Nebukadinesa uwaishile teeka ku Babiloni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ifyo balengele mwilangi ilyakashika, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abaume abali ne mishipi iyakakwa mu misana yabo, ne nsalu ishapombwa ku mitwe yabo. Bonse balemoneka nge ntungulushi sha bashilika abena Babiloni abafuma ku calo ca Kaludea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuti nga aloleshapo, awe no mutima munda walabilimafye kukushikumbwa, asuka nomba alatumina ne ntungulushi shine inkombe ku calo ica Kaludea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Babiloni nabo epakulaisa kuli ena ku busanshi bwa citemwiko, na mu lwinso lwabo bamukowesha icakuti pakulekelesha nao asuka abatendwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo atwalilile na bucilende bwakwe, aleitakisha pa lwalala pali bucilende bwakwe, alefuula alelangisha no mubili wakwe. Na ine nasukile natendwa, nga filya fine natendelwe nkashi nankwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awe nao elyo nomba acilililako ukulacita ubulalelale ubo atampilefye mu Egupto, ilyo ali umukashana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kulya eko alatemwisha impusaushi sha baume ishali ne mibili ikulu nge ya bapunda, iyaluma ubushinso mukwitulula nge mfalashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwe Oliba, ulefwaya nakabili ukulacita ubulalelale, nga filya walecita ilyo wali umukashana mu Egupto, umo abaume balekutonya amabele no kulakupampanta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanshi we Oliba ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, iwe nautendwa balya bantu watemenwe, nomba ine nkalenga bakakufulilwe, no kukushinga bakese kushinguluka mpangafye yonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Babiloni na bena Kaludea bonse, abena Pekodi, na bena Shoa, na bena Koa, na bena Asiria bonse, aba bonse bali abalumendo abayemba, bonse bali balashi elyo ne ntungulushi sha fita, abendela pali bakabalwe. Bonse bali abakalamba mu milimo yabuteko kabili abaleendela pali bakabalwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakwisa kusansa bakesa ne fyanso, amaceleta, ne fya mipeto fimbi elyo ne fita ifingi. Pakukushinguluka bakekatilila inkwela ishikalamba ne shinono, no kufwala ifimpompo. Nine nkabeba ukukupingula, nabo bakakupingula ukulingana ne fyebo fyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaleka bakakutakanye ku cipyu candi, pantu ine ninkufulilwa. Bakakuteta imyona na matwi, bakepaya na bonse abakashalamo ku lupanga. Bakakupoka bamwano abaume na banakashi, bakaboce na mu mulilo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakulepawila ifyakufwala, no kukufuula ifisamiko ifyayemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efyo ine nkakupwisha bucilende bobe, nkakupwisha ne myendele yobe imbi iyabipisha iyo wakwete ilyo wali mu Egupto. Tawakatale nakabili aufuluka nelyo ukwibukisha icalo cabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ifi efyasosa Imfumu Yawe ati, ine nkakutwala ku bantu abo iwe wapata, kabili abo watendwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakakupokafye fyonse ifyo wabombela, elyo kabili bakakushe ubwamba, pantu nabo bene balikupata. Bakakusha ukwabula ukufwala, epakuti ukaseebane pali bucilende bobe. Ubupulumushi bobe na bucilende ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "efikakuletelela, pantu walekumbwa imishobo pakucita nabo bucilende, twasuka no tulubi twabo twakukowesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Walikonkelela imisango yakwa nkashi mbiyo, e mulandu wine na ine nkabika ulukombo lwakwa nkashi mbiyo mu minwe yobe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
