    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Yawe alinjebele ati, “We mwana wa muntu, bushe ulefwaya ukupingula Ohola na Oliba? Kanshi iwe bakalipile pa fintu ifyabunani ifyo bacita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balyobelwa ku bucende no mulopa uli mu minwe yabo, balacita ubucende no tulubi twabo, balipaya abana abaume abo bafyele kuli ine. Balibuula abana bandi no kubatuula ilambo ilyakupakisha utulubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teapo peka bapelela iyoo, balilundapo no kukowesha icifulo candi icamushilo, no konaula Amasabata yandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batile bashiipaya abana babo pakubatuula ilambo ku tulubi, ubo bwine bushiku balishile no kukowesha cifulo candi icamushilo. Nefi efyo bacita mu ŋanda yandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kabili balitumine inkombe ishakuya ita abaume abali ukutali, awe nabo baisa. Pakusembeleka abaume, abanakashi epakusamba, basuba na mafuta bapenta na ku menso, bafwala ne fyakuisamika ifyamutengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baikala na pa musengele uusuma, bapalamika ne tebulo ilyo baanshikepo ubusaka. Babikapo ububani na mafuta ya miolifa, ifintu ifyali fyandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyu mwanakashi ashingulwikwe ne bumba lya bamungulu abalecita icongo, elyo mu matololo mwafumine ibumba lya bacakolwa nabo bafwika na banakashi amakosa ku maboko, ne ngala ishayemba ku mitwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ine epakulanda palwa uyo umwanakashi uo bucilende bwaonaula nati, nabatwalilile ukumubomfya muli bucilende, pantu ena efyo aba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na baume bacili baleya uko ali, kwati ni kuli cilende baleya. Efyo baya na kuli Ohola na Oliba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 23:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba abantu abololoke bakabapeela umulandu kulwa bucende bwabo, na kulwa bupondo bwabo, pantu balacita ubucende no kulaipaisha abantu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.23.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.23.45"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
